<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Thank You for Beginning This Journey – Kwizera Charity Foundation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f0f0f0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      }
      img {
        border: 0;
        display: block;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      /* Header */
      .header {
        background-color: #e8b84b;
        padding: 32px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header-icon {
        font-size: 30px;
        color: #2d3748;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        color: #2d3748;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }
      .header p {
        margin: 0;
        color: #4a5568;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      /* Hero */
      .hero {
        line-height: 0;
      }
      .hero img {
        width: 100%;
        max-height: 280px;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      /* Body */
      .body {
        padding: 40px 44px;
        color: #4a5568;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
      .body p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-size: 21px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2d3748;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 24px;
      }

      /* Story card */
      .story {
        background: #fdf6ec;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 24px 28px;
        margin: 24px 0 28px;
      }
      .story h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: #2d3748;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .story p {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .story p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      /* Steps */
      .steps-title {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2d3748;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }
      .step-row {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .step-num {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: #e8b84b;
        border-radius: 50%;
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #2d3748;
        line-height: 40px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }
      .step-cell {
        padding-left: 16px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }
      .step-cell h4 {
        margin: 4px 0 4px;
        color: #2d3748;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .step-cell p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #4a5568;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      /* Quote */
      .quote {
        border-left: 4px solid #e8b84b;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }
      .quote p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #4a5568;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .avatar {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: #e8b84b;
        border-radius: 50%;
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #2d3748;
        line-height: 40px;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }
      .author-cell {
        padding-left: 12px;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }
      .author-name {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2d3748;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .author-role {
        color: #718096;
        font-size: 12px;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* CTA */
      .cta {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 28px 0 24px;
      }
      .cta a {
        background: #e8b84b;
        color: #2d3748;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 36px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 15px;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      /* Signoff */
      .signoff {
        text-align: center;
        color: #4a5568;
        font-size: 15px;
        padding-top: 8px;
      }
      .signoff p {
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .footer {
        background: #fdf6ec;
        padding: 32px 40px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .footer-title {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #2d3748;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      .social-icons {
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }
      .social-icon {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 42px;
        height: 42px;
        border: 1px solid #e2d3b8;
        border-radius: 50%;
        margin: 0 4px;
        line-height: 42px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #4a5568;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 17px;
        background: #ffffff;
      }
      .footer-info {
        color: #718096;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin: 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='wrapper'>

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class='header'>
        <div class='header-icon'>&#9829;</div>
        <h1>Kwizera Charity Foundation</h1>
        <p>Building brighter futures in Kigali, Rwanda</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero image -->
      <div class='hero'>
        <img
          src='cid:kids-hero'
          alt='KCF children'
          width='600'
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class='body'>
        <p class='section-title'>Thank You for Beginning This Journey</p>

        <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>We are deeply grateful that you've chosen to register your interest
          in sponsoring a child through Kwizera. Your compassion and generosity
          are the first steps toward transforming a young life in Kigali.</p>
        <p>Every child deserves hope, education, and the chance to dream. Today,
          you've made that possible for one special child who will soon become
          your little bestie.</p>

        <!-- Story -->
        <div class='story'>
          <h3>Our Story: Born from Hope During COVID-19</h3>
          <p>Kwizera Charity Foundation was founded during the COVID-19 pandemic
            when our founder, Eric, witnessed firsthand how vulnerable children
            in Kigali were being left behind. Schools closed, families
            struggled, and dreams were fading.</p>
          <p>But we believed in a different future. "Kwizera" means "hope" in
            Kinyarwanda, and that's exactly what we've been building—one child,
            one sponsor, one meaningful relationship at a time.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Steps -->
        <p class='steps-title'>What Happens Next</p>
        <table width='100%' cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
          <tr>
            <td width='40' style='width:40px;padding:0;' valign='top'>
              <div style='width:40px;height:40px;background:#e8b84b;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;color:#2d3748;line-height:40px;'>1</div>
            </td>
            <td class='step-cell'>
              <h4>We Review Your Interest</h4>
              <p>Our team carefully considers your preferences and commitment to find the perfect match.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td colspan='2' height='18'></td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td width='40' style='width:40px;padding:0;' valign='top'>
              <div style='width:40px;height:40px;background:#e8b84b;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;color:#2d3748;line-height:40px;'>2</div>
            </td>
            <td class='step-cell'>
              <h4>We Find Your Child Match</h4>
              <p>We identify a child whose story, dreams, and needs align with your sponsorship journey.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td colspan='2' height='18'></td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td width='40' style='width:40px;padding:0;' valign='top'>
              <div style='width:40px;height:40px;background:#e8b84b;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;color:#2d3748;line-height:40px;'>3</div>
            </td>
            <td class='step-cell'>
              <h4>We Prepare Your Sponsorship Pack</h4>
              <p>You'll receive a comprehensive digital pack with all the details about your new little bestie.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td colspan='2' height='18'></td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td width='40' style='width:40px;padding:0;' valign='top'>
              <div style='width:40px;height:40px;background:#e8b84b;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;color:#2d3748;line-height:40px;'>4</div>
            </td>
            <td class='step-cell'>
              <h4>You Meet Your Sponsored Child</h4>
              <p>The most exciting moment—seeing their smile and learning about their dreams for the first time.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- Quote -->
        <div class='quote'>
          <p>"Every child we support reminds me why we started this journey.
            It's not about charity—it's about building genuine, life-changing
            relationships that give our children the tools to build their own
            futures."</p>
          <table cellpadding='0' cellspacing='0' border='0'>
            <tr>
              <td class='avatar' width='40'>E</td>
              <td class='author-cell'>
                <p class='author-name'>Eric</p>
                <p class='author-role'>Founder, Kwizera Charity Foundation</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class='cta'>
          <a href='https://kwizeracharityfoundation.org'>Learn More About Our
            Mission</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Signoff -->
        <div class='signoff'>
          <p>With gratitude and hope,</p>
          <p><strong>The Kwizera Team</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class='footer'>
        <p class='footer-title'>Stay Connected</p>
        <div class='social-icons'>
          <a href='https://kwizeracharityfoundation.org' class='social-icon' style='font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;'>W</a>
          <a href='https://www.instagram.com/kwizeracharityfoundation' class='social-icon' style='font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;'>IG</a>
          <a href='https://www.facebook.com/KwizeraCharityFoundation' class='social-icon' style='font-size:17px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;'>f</a>
          <a href='mailto:info@kwizeracharityfoundation.org' class='social-icon' style='font-size:15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;'>@</a>
        </div>
        <p class='footer-info'>
          Kwizera Charity Foundation<br />
          Kigali, Rwanda<br />
          info@kwizeracharityfoundation.org
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>